  "cnd2:13.3": "khattiyā brāhmaṇā devatānaṃ ",
  "cnd2:13.4": "yaññamakappayiṃsu puthu idha loke ",
  "cnd2:13.5": "āsiṃsamānā puṇṇaka itthabhāvaṃ ",
  "cnd2:13.6": "jaraṃsitā yaññamakappayiṃsu. 3-3 ",
  "cnd2:14.1": "ye keci ‘me isayo manujā ",
  "cnd2:14.2": "(iccāyasmā puṇṇako) ",
  "cnd2:14.3": "khattiyā brāhmaṇā devatānaṃ ",
  "cnd2:14.4": "yaññamakappayiṃsu puthu idha loke ",
  "cnd2:14.5": "kaccissu te bhagavā yaññapathe appamattā ",
  "cnd2:14.6": "atāru jātiṃ ca jaraṃ ca mārisa ",
  "cnd2:14.7": "pucchāmi taṃ bhagavā brūhi metaṃ. 3-4 ",
