  "cnd2:15.5": "nātariṃsu jātijaranti brūmi. 3-5 ",
  "cnd2:16.1": "te ce nātariṃsu yājayogā ",
  "cnd2:16.2": "(iccāyasmā puṇṇako) ",
  "cnd2:16.3": "yaññehi jātiñca jarañca mārisa ",
