  "cnd2:46.0": "",
  "cnd2:46.1": "santi loke munayo ",
  "cnd2:46.2": "(iccāyasmā nando) ",
  "cnd2:46.3": "janā vadanti tayidaṃ kathaṃsu ",
  "cnd2:46.4": "ñāṇūpapannaṃ no muniṃ vadanti ",
  "cnd2:46.5": "udāhu ve jīvitenūpapannaṃ. 7-2 ",
  "cnd2:47.1": "na diṭṭhiyā na sutiyā na ñāṇena (nandā’ti bhagavā) ",
  "cnd2:47.2": "munīdha nanda kusalā vadanti ",
  "cnd2:47.3": "viseni katvā anīghā nirāsā ",
  "cnd2:47.4": "caranti ye te munayo’ti brūmi. 7-3 ",
