  "cnd2:51.6": "anekarūpampi pahāya sabbaṃ ",
  "cnd2:51.7": "taṇhaṃ pariññāya anāsavā se ",
  "cnd2:51.8": "te ve narā oghatiṇṇā’ti brūmi. 7-8 ",
